---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`Real Life Friends | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Making real friends as an adult shouldn't be this hard. We match you with people who actually get your situation." />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Real Life Friends</h1>
			<p>
				Making real friends as an adult shouldn't be this hard.
			</p>

			<h2>The Problem</h2>
			<p>
				You moved to a new city. You work remotely. Your old friends are scattered across the country. 
				Apps give you endless profiles but no real connections. You're not looking for networking events 
				or forced group activities—you just want to meet someone who gets it.
			</p>

			<h2>How It Works</h2>
			<p>
				We match you with one person at a time based on what actually matters: where you are in life, 
				what you're looking for, and why you'd genuinely enjoy meeting each other.
			</p>
			<p>
				No swiping. No algorithms optimizing for engagement. Just thoughtful introductions between 
				people who have a real reason to connect.
			</p>

			<h2>What Makes Us Different</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Intent first</strong> — We match based on what kind of connection you're actually looking for, whether that's an activity partner, someone for deep conversations, or just low-key friendship.</li>
				<li><strong>Life context matters</strong> — New to town? Working remote? Going through a transition? We connect you with people navigating similar situations, not just people who like the same hobbies.</li>
				<li><strong>Clear next steps</strong> — Every introduction comes with a specific reason to meet, a suggested spot, and a conversation starter. No awkward "so... why are we here?"</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>Pilot Program</h2>
			<p>
				We're starting small with a pilot in Bend, Oregon. If you're interested in being part of the 
				first cohort, reach out.
			</p>

			<p>
				<a href="/">← Back to Home</a>
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
